# Marvin's machinery is tracked; its notes are local to each machine.
#
# Deny-by-default: jj auto-tracks new files on every snapshot, so a note type
# nobody thought to ignore would otherwise become publishable by accident.
# Everything under marvin/ is ignored unless re-included below.
marvin/*
!marvin/AGENTS.md
!marvin/CLAUDE.md
!marvin/README.md
